[comment encoding = UTF-8 /]
[module GenerateDocumentation('http://www.example.org/reporting')]

[comment Generates a Markdown document with the figures of a sales report. /]
[template public generateDocumentation(report : SalesReport)]
[comment @main /]
[file ('sales-report.md', false, 'UTF-8')]
# Sales Report: [report.shopName/]

Generated by GenerateDocumentation.mtl from the sales report model.

## Key Figures

| Figure | Value |
| --- | ---: |
| Total revenue | [report.totalRevenue/] |
| Orders | [report.totalOrders/] |
| Units sold | [report.totalUnits/] |

## Categories

| Category | Products | Units sold | Sales | Average price |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
[for (m : CategoryMetric | report.categoryMetrics)]
| [m.categoryName/] | [m.productCount/] | [m.unitsSold/] | [m.totalSales/] | [m.avgProductPrice/] |
[/for]

## Customers

| Customer | Email | Orders | Spent | Average order |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
[for (m : CustomerMetric | report.customerMetrics)]
| [m.customerName/] | [m.email/] | [m.orderCount/] | [m.totalSpent/] | [m.avgOrderValue/] |
[/for]

## Products

| SKU | Product | Category | Units sold | Revenue | Stock |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
[for (m : ProductMetric | report.productMetrics)]
| [m.sku/] | [m.productName/] | [m.categoryName/] | [m.unitsSold/] | [m.revenue/] | [m.stock/] |
[/for]

## Out of Stock

[for (m : ProductMetric | report.productMetrics->select(p | p.stock = 0))]
- [m.productName/] ([m.sku/])
[/for]
[/file]
[/template]
